{"text": "Tanto así que y también vamos a hacer nomás jeshbón para tenerlo claro, ¿sí? Aquí hay dos opciones. Vamos a agarrar las dos opciones tanto para Rebe y tanto para Panam. Para Rebe, ¿cuál es la opción número uno? Es así. Según Rebe, kria Shemá, ¿cómo se dice? Dafkam, la zona codesh. Entonces, dice la Gemara, entonces a lo mejor toda la Torá es bejol lasón. De lo que he decidido acá. Entonces, ora qué aprendí", "language_code": "spa", "language_probability": 1, "words": [{"text": "Tanto", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.36, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.36, "end": 0.38, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "así", "start": 0.38, "end": 0.6, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.68, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "que", "start": 0.68, "end": 0.74, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.74, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "y", "start": 35.54, "end": 35.6, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 35.6, "end": 35.68, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "también", "start": 35.68, "end": 36.06, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 36.06, "end": 36.1, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "vamos", "start": 36.1, "end": 36.3, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 36.3, "end": 36.32, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "a", "start": 36.32, "end": 36.32, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 36.32, "end": 36.34, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "hacer", "start": 36.34, "end": 36.46, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 36.46, "end": 36.5, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "nomás", "start": 36.5, "end": 36.7, "type": "word", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": " ", "start": 36.7, "end": 36.78, "type": "spacing", "speaker_id": null}, {"text": "jeshbón", "start": 3